		"en": [
			"• HG The ZGMF-X10A Freedom GUNDAM, which appeared as part of the HG SEED series, has been reborn and is now available.",
			"• Powerful action is reproduced with a sharp style and a wide range of motion.",
			"• Abdominal movement due to double joints. Leg joints with a wide range of motion.",
			"• Shoulders that can be moved up and down. Includes beam rifle, beam saber, and shield. The saber can be linked."
		]
